# MineBox secrets (EXAMPLE — do not commit real values)
# Appliance path: /etc/minebox/secrets.env  (mode 0600, root:minebox readable)
#
# Image-build bootstrap values may exist temporarily before first-boot
# rotation. After first-boot setup completes, universal defaults must not
# remain active.

# Dashboard session signing key (auto-generated if omitted; prefer auth.json).
# MINEBOX_SESSION_SECRET=

# SoftAP WPA-PSK. Bootstrap image value is temporary only.
# HOTSPOT_PSK=

# Shared RCON fallback for migration of old installs.
# Prefer per-server /opt/minecraft/servers/<id>/.minebox-rcon-password
# Never ship a universal production RCON password.
# RCON_PASSWORD=

# Optional Tailscale auth key (remote access disabled by default).
# TAILSCALE_AUTHKEY=
